      "maskDescription": "Generates object and lane detections for actors and lanes in the 3D visualization environment.  If you set the sample time to -1, the block uses the sample time specified in the Simulation 3D Scene Configuration block. To use this sensor, ensure that the Simulation 3D Scene Configuration block is in your model.",
